  "aboutVideoPageTitle": "Video - Field benchmarks",
  "aboutVideoSummaryCopy": "VIDEO - landmarks\n- Resolution = size (px). FPS = fluidity / latency.\n- 4:2:2 / 4:4:4 + 10-bit = color quality.\n- SDI = robust + long distance.\n- HDMI = fragile + short.\n- NDI = IP (network), depends on LAN.\n- Genlock / Timecode = synchro.",
  "aboutVideoChecklistCopy": "VIDEO - Checklist\n☐ Same resolution & FPS everywhere\n☐ HDMI: EDID / HDCP mastered\n☐ SDI: 75Ω cable + good standard\n☐ NDI/IP: clean LAN (switch, speed)\n☐ Genlock / Timecode if synchro required\n☐ Test source → direct screen",
  "aboutVideoChecklistCopyTooltip": "Copy",
  "aboutVideoFooterNote": "Indicative information (field). Behavior varies according to equipment.\nObjective: understand quickly and troubleshoot cleanly.",
  "aboutVideoToc1": "1) Video basics (keywords)",
  "aboutVideoToc2": "2) Resolution & FPS",
  "aboutVideoToc3": "3) Color (4:4:4 / 4:2:2 / 10-bit)",
  "aboutVideoToc4": "4) Sync (Genlock / Timecode)",
  "aboutVideoToc5": "5) Cables & distances",
  "aboutVideoToc6": "6) SDI (3G / 6G / 12G)",
