  "aboutVideoToc9": "9) Mapping / LED / multi-projo",
  "aboutVideoSection1Paragraph": "Video is an image (pixels) sent at a rate (FPS), with a color structure (sampling / bit depth), transported by a link (SDI / HDMI / IP) and sometimes synchronized.",
